    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a cozy journey in Shippin\u00b4s world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/45d24b8982116e0a1d47ab34f8a5c15a.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/45d24b8982116e0a1d47ab34f8a5c15a.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/45d24b8982116e0a1d47ab34f8a5c15a.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Salva, a lost sailor driven by a desire to uncover how he arrived in these uncharted seas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the heart of the sea, one island at a time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/ed0cfe35a9240b157646d3f1e493bfc6.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/ed0cfe35a9240b157646d3f1e493bfc6.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/ed0cfe35a9240b157646d3f1e493bfc6.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your wits, your fishing rod, and a bit of luck, you\u2019ll set out to help the residents of each harbor you visit, and <strong>find the way home.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share stories during your trip!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/9fa608ce33cfba85780159cebeddff81.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/9fa608ce33cfba85780159cebeddff81.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/9fa608ce33cfba85780159cebeddff81.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share stories, and secrets of their world. Choose to listen, respond, or let the mysteries unfold in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DISCLAIMER</i></strong><i>:</i> <i>There are jokes in this game.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use all your equipment to help the harbor people!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/b3bd473fbd15f85049db572e2f4e66c4.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/b3bd473fbd15f85049db572e2f4e66c4.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/b3bd473fbd15f85049db572e2f4e66c4.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing, exploring the ocean\u2019s depths, and experiencing magical moments are just a few of the many things you'll encounter as you uncover the hidden wonders of each island you visit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fill Your Compendium with Ocean Treasures!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/2e9f29ef090230f4ee9e369434d2552a.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/2e9f29ef090230f4ee9e369434d2552a.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/2e9f29ef090230f4ee9e369434d2552a.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the sailor's compendium with the different fish and relics that you obtain throughout your entire journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a cozy journey in Shippin\u00b4s world!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/45d24b8982116e0a1d47ab34f8a5c15a.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/45d24b8982116e0a1d47ab34f8a5c15a.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/45d24b8982116e0a1d47ab34f8a5c15a.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Salva, a lost sailor driven by a desire to uncover how he arrived in these uncharted seas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the heart of the sea, one island at a time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/ed0cfe35a9240b157646d3f1e493bfc6.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/ed0cfe35a9240b157646d3f1e493bfc6.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/ed0cfe35a9240b157646d3f1e493bfc6.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your wits, your fishing rod, and a bit of luck, you\u2019ll set out to help the residents of each harbor you visit, and <strong>find the way home.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share stories during your trip!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"