e_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/2e9f29ef090230f4ee9e369434d2552a.poster.avif?t=1733877169\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/2e9f29ef090230f4ee9e369434d2552a.webm?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334100/extras/2e9f29ef090230f4ee9e369434d2552a.mp4?t=1733877169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the sailor's compendium with the different fish and relics that you obtain throughout your entire journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
